VST gHost: Direct2D-era plugin editors under Wine (JUCE 8/9 and other DirectComposition users).

- dcomp: minimal DirectComposition (device, target, visual, Commit) that binds a swap chain to a window.
- dxgi: CreateSwapChainForComposition = a swap chain on a hidden helper window; Present copies the back
  buffer into the bound window with GDI; frame-latency waitable object implemented.
- dxgi: IDXGIOutput::WaitForVBlank waits ~16 ms and returns S_OK (JUCE 9 paints only on vblank).
- dwrite: keep the factory's reference to the cached system font collection (was rebuilt per call).

