+/* Model: a device owns targets (one per HWND); a target has a root visual; a visual's content
+ * can be a DXGI swap chain made with CreateSwapChainForComposition. On Commit() each target tells
+ * its root visual's swap chain which window to present into (private data, read by dxgi's
+ * composition present path). Transforms, effects, clips, child visuals and animations are
+ * accepted and ignored. This is what JUCE 8's Direct2D renderer (and other single-visual users)
+ * needs. */
